if you don't feel like playing.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.133
Whatever you want.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:31.167
We're gonna see the results
live, though, right here.

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.434
And, Higgins,
you have your clicker?

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:33.767
Roots, got your clickers?
-Got it.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.100
-Mm-hmm.
-Alright.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.501
Whatever tweet
gets the most likes,

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:39.033
we will tweet it out live
during the commercial break,

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.100
and then you can all like it
and WeTweet it.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.501
-[ Laughs sarcastically ]

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.901
